  <p>Vivitrol supports the physical element of recovering from AUD. Psychotherapy, such as cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), is still necessary alongside Vivitrol to address mental challenges, including processing the trauma underneath addiction and reframing negative thought patterns.</p>

  <h2 id="how-long-it-lasts">How Long Does Vivitrol Last?</h2>
  <p>Vivitrol typically comes as a 380 mg intramuscular injection given every four weeks (28&ndash;30 days) to maintain its effects. How long it lasts depends on how quickly the body breaks down the slow-release formula, which varies from person to person.</p>
  <p>The half-life of Vivitrol&mdash;how long it takes to break down to half the original amount in the body&mdash;is 5&ndash;10 days. It generally takes about five half-lives for a drug to be fully eliminated, so Vivitrol clears the body in roughly 25 to 50 days [4].</p>

